        "accession_number": "0000046619-25-000082",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-22",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "HEICO Corporation through its subsidiaries (collectively, “HEICO,” “we,” “us,” “our” or the “Company”) believes it is the world’s largest manufacturer of Federal Aviation Administration (“FAA”)-approved jet engine and aircraft component replacement parts, other than the original equipment manufacturers (“OEMs”) and their subcontractors.",
